WEBVTT

00:02.280 --> 00:05.500
We shall proceed as Commandant Chu advises.

00:06.680 --> 00:10.000
Since Your Highness has decided, this humble officer offers another counsel.

00:10.080 --> 00:17.240
If the Chen faction frames Yu Gong under the banner of "Propriety and Law," then we shall rescue him under the banner of "Loyalty and Filial Piety"!

00:17.480 --> 00:24.600
Your Highness must enter the palace at once, before morning court, and settle this behind closed doors directly with His Majesty.

00:24.760 --> 00:27.760
Remember, Your Highness: anchor everything to "Loyalty and Filial Piety."

00:28.320 --> 00:29.720
I understand.

00:37.360 --> 00:45.680
Eunuch Wen, Father is not in his bedchambers?
His Majesty is in the Imperial Elixir Chamber, refining new pills.

00:49.480 --> 00:54.840
He has been at it all night? Father is still practicing Daoist alchemy?
This humble servant could not say, Your Highness.
